  "body": "\"\"\"New devices (or firmware updates) may include a list of acceptable origins that the user agent can query, similar to the CORS mechanism for HTTP requests. Device vendors may enable existing devices by registering them in an open directory which maps device IDs to acceptable origins.\"\"\"\n\nHow do we make sure the list is not supplied by the attacker?\n",
